    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Dear Mr. D,\r\n\tI got through! There\u2019s a whole big room where
        the back room should be. I only got a quick look inside, but it looked like
        some sort of dance hall. Didn\u2019t seem like the type of place I\u2019d
        be able to blend in, so I\u2019m gonna send Lena now that I know the place."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[1].text
      value: "Seems much more her speed with all the fancy dressed ladies and loud
        music. It\u2019s also definitely the sort of thing that Clancy would want
        to know about. I did learn that there was a real rowdy rub on Friday (some
        famous singer is performing), so there\u2019ll be plenty of cover that day."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[2].text
      value: "It\u2019s likely our best bet for a clean mission. Not sure where you\u2019ll
        find the plans for this place, but I bet it\u2019s buried somewhere in your
        papers. Maybe on some older plans that you got your hands on before they\u2019d
        had a chance to edit them? I couldn\u2019t see anywhere specific that we
        want to check out,"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[3].text
      value: "so it\u2019s probably best to let Lena get a look at the whole place.
        And if I know her at all, you should definitely let her explore the dance
        floor in her walkabout. Send your plans along to Lena when you have them.\n\nCharlie"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8126872563991681825, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
